ANTs v2.6.5: the antsApplyTransforms.cxx part of ANTsX/ANTs#2032 (merged as e4a06528a),
"COMP: replace char with explicit (un)signed char", by Philip A Cook.
Plain char is unsigned on Linux arm64, so v2.6.5 maps char pixels to unsigned there.
The rest of #2032 touches programs MRIQC does not ship, and does not apply to v2.6.5.

